    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tojoŋo akica ŋina ke Ekapolon ayakau Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai ayoŋ eŋoliya nariwo ŋina eyai kidiama ŋakyes a ŋisubuna a ŋulu a ŋabebenuk, ayai nen ibore ŋini ekwaan ka ekicoloŋ ŋolo itiyaunitae a ŋamoru a ŋunapusiyek a ŋuna enyaritae Sapire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Akuj neni a ekile a ŋolo anapit ŋilowi ŋulu amilimilak, “Ape toloma kidiŋ ŋiboorei ŋulu ikwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari ŋulu eyakasi kwap ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk kilelebik a nen alokidiŋ ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk, ŋatotol nakan kon, ido kielak lotaun.” Abu ayoŋ eteo ekile ŋol elosi alomar Kai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awuasi ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk alowae a ŋolo alo kwap Akai ka Akuj elomari ekile ŋol Kai ka Akuj, ido abu edou kilelebun nalapatu ŋina alokidiŋ Akai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai akica ŋina ka Akuj tolomu aneni a ŋisubuna a ŋulu a ŋabebenuk, min lopuke ŋolo ka Akai ka Akuj; kilelebun edou Kai ka Akuj ka kilelebun akwaŋis ŋina ka akica a Ekapolon nalapatu ŋina ka Akai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, apedoritae akiirar eruye a ŋabebenuk a ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk tari iyai nalapatu ŋina alokiŋa Akai ka Akuj, ekoni eruye ŋol irworikini etoil ka Akuj a ŋina etiron.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani elimokini Akuj ekile ŋolo anapit ŋilowi ŋulu amilimilak alemun akim alokidiŋ ŋiboorei ŋulu ikwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari ŋulu aya kidiŋ ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk, abu ekile ŋol toloma Kai ka Akuj; towo alodiyete epei a ŋiboorei a ŋulu ikwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu epei a ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk kiopeiyo akan keŋ nakim ŋina ayai nen kidiŋ kec, tolemu akim adio, kiwuak nakan a ekile a ŋolo a napit ŋilowi ŋulu amilimilak, ya ekile ŋol akim tolomarya kiŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ayoŋ eŋolik ŋolosubuna eyakar akan ŋina ekoni ŋina a ituŋanan kwap abebenukat keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani aŋoleŋolekini ayoŋ, abu eŋolik alodiyete ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk ŋiboorei ŋulu ekwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari, diyete ŋolosubuna, ayai ipei, anakinwakete ŋiboorei ŋulu ekwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari ŋul ikwa amoru ŋina enyaŋiyarit ŋina enyaritae Karisolite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atakanete ŋiboorei ŋulu ekwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari ŋuluomwon ŋul ikwaan, tooma ŋiboorei ŋulu ekwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari ŋul, ayai ibore ice ŋini ekwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani erotokinete ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk apedorito alosit ŋolowae ca daadaŋ emam akiŋoliyar lowae ŋolo elosete ikes. Apedorito ikes alosit kaapei lowae ŋolo elosi ibore ŋini ekwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari ŋini iŋareni, amam ŋuluce aboboŋ lowae ŋolo elosete ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi ŋakonyen nawat a ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk tari nakausinei, nakan, nabebenuk ka loboorei ŋuluomwon ŋulu ekwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari daŋ eleleba ŋakonyen ŋiwaetin daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani apupi ayoŋ, anyaritae ŋiboorei ŋulu ekwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari ŋul ebe, “Ŋiboorei ŋulu ikwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari ipiripirete elosete kaapei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakatar ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk ŋuluomwon ŋul daadaŋ ŋireetin, ekoni ereet a ŋolo ke ekiŋaren ŋolo a esubuna a ŋolo a ŋabebenuk, ŋolo a ŋiarei, ekoni ereet ŋolo a ituŋanan, ŋolo a ŋiuni, ekoni ereet ŋolo a eŋatuny ka ŋolo a ŋiomwon, ekoni ereet ŋolo a egole.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋul ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk ŋulupei sek eŋolikinit ayoŋ alodiyete aŋolol Kebar. Ani enyounete ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "apaki ŋina arotokinioto, apotu ŋiboorei ŋulu ekwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari daŋ ŋul toloto ka ikes ibakarito kaapei. Ani epororete ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk alokwap, apotu ŋiboorei ŋulu ekwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari daŋ ŋul torukosi kaapei ka ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ewoete ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk, towua ikes daŋ, ani epororete ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk, toporosi ikes daŋ kaapei ka ikes, anerae ayai etau a ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk neni a ŋiboorei a ŋulu ekwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari a ŋul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai akica ŋina a Ekapolon tolot alopuke a ŋolo ka Akai ka Akuj, min kidiama ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk kikeut ŋabebenuk kec, toporosi alokwap ete ayoŋ elosete kaapei ka ŋiboorei ŋulu ekwaan ka ŋakejen a agaari ŋul. Towua ikes alopuke a ŋolo alo Kide Akai ka Akuj, ayai kidiama kec akica ŋina ka Akuj a Ŋisirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋul ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk ŋulu sek eŋolikinit ayoŋ alodiyete aŋolol Kebar, eyakasi kwap Akuj ŋina a Ŋisirael, ido ayeni ayoŋ atemar arae ikes ŋisubuna ŋulu a ŋabebenuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakar ŋolosubuna ŋireetin ŋiomwon ka ŋabebenuk ŋaomwon, ido kwap ŋabebenuk kec, ayakasi ŋiboorei ŋulu ekwaan ka ŋakan a ituŋanan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai epite ŋolo atakaniata ŋireetin kec, arae ŋulu ekwaan ka ŋulu sek eŋolikinit ayoŋ alodiyete aŋolol Kebar. Abu ŋolosubuna torubak elosi kiŋaren jik emam akiri iwace.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
